[BRIGMORE.ChapterLog_Brigmore DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Notes: Brigmore Estate"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Delilah Copperspoon's hideout is the old Brigmore Estate. Infiltrate the estate and find her."

[BRIGMORE.Chapternotes_Brigmore_keyhint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Key to the Estate"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="A witch named Isabelle seems to have the estate key. She is in the back yard."

[BRIGMORE.Chapternotes_Brigmore_lanternhint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Magic Lantern"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="The lantern is apparently used to open a gate through one of Delilah's paintings.  "

[BRIGMORE.Chapternotes_Brigmore_leverhint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="A Heavy Lever"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="This lever belongs to some mechanism. Perhaps searching the grounds is in order."

[BRIGMORE.Chapternotes_Brigmore_Overhint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Kaldwin Girl"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Apparently Emily Kaldwin and the paintings of her are central to Delilah's plans."

[BRIGMORE.Chapternotes_Brigmore_studiohint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Delilah's studio"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Delilah has a studio somewhere inside the manor. It seems to contain something of value."

[BRIGMORE.Chapternotes_Brigmore_switchhint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Missing Lever Location"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="A mechanized lid to the tomb of Jessop Brigmore has been disabled. The missing lever may be in the estate's garden shed."

[Coldridge.ChapterLog_Coldridge DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Notes: Coldridge Prison"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride, the leader of the Dead Eels, is somewhere inside Coldridge Prison. The former Lord Protector's escape has put the place on high alert."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_AngryPrisoner DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Angry Prisoner"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="The Prisoner in cell D03 has a score to settle with one of the guards. Opening his cell could create a good distraction."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_ArcPylon DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Arc Pylon"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="An Arc Pylon guards the entry way. Escaping prisoners don't stand a chance against it."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_CrazedPrisoner_A15 DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Unstable Prisoner"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="The man in cell A15 seems unstable. Opening his cell could create a distraction."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_CrazedPrisoner_D22 DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Unstable Prisoner"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="The man in cell D22 seems unstable. Opening his cell could create a distraction."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_Disguise DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Overseer Disguise"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="You’ve donned an Overseer disguise in order to infiltrate Coldridge Prison. The prison guards summoned an Overseer to investigate an occult scene in the interrogation room, and will probably expect you to play the part."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_Hatter DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="The Hatter"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="The Hatter in cell D11 wants Lizzy Stride dead."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_Helpful DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Helpful Guard"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Guards are being executed in the courtyard. They may have useful information to share if they were spared."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_LizzyCarry DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Carry Stride"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride can't walk, she'll need to be carried out of Coldridge."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_LizzyStride DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Lizzy Stride"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride is the leader of the Eels, and a difficult prisoner. Extra precautions have been taken to keep her locked up."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_Logbook DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="The Log Book"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="A log book of all transfers within the prison is kept in the guard booth between sections C and D. Lizzy's cell number should be in there."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_Offlimits DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Off Limits"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="The cell controls above the courtyard, prisoner cell blocks, and execution yard are off limits."

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_StrideCell_A00 DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Stride's Cell"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride is being held in cell A00"

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_StrideCell_A21 DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Stride's Cell"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride is being held in cell A21"

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_StrideCell_C28 DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Stride's Cell"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride is being held in cell C28"

[Coldridge.ChapterNotes_StrideCell_D24 DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Stride's Cell"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride is being held in cell D24"

[DrapersWard.ChapterLog_DrapersWard DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Notes: Drapers Ward"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Lizzy Stride, leader of the Dead Eels gang, is captain of the ship Undine. Aid Lizzy and use the Undine to sail up the river to Brigmore Manor."

