[DrapersWard.Chapternotes_Mill_Combohint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Engine Coil"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="A combination is needed to reach the engine coil running the mill. Find the Geezer to see if he will make a deal to give it up."

[DrapersWard.Chapternotes_Mill_Formulahint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Search Lab"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Search Nurse Trimble's lab for the antitoxin formula."

[DrapersWard.Chapternotes_Mill_Gashint DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Toxic Gas Release"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="If the Geezer dies or is unhooked from his life support it will release a toxic gas that will kill everyone in the Mill. The gas can eat through a gas mask."

